    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "note": "Security update from 1.45.1: fixes GHSA-mf5v-w3w3-f6cg / CVE-2026-126360 (quadratic-time traceparent regex in TraceContextTextMapPropagator.extract). The only code change against the reviewed 1.45.1 is that fix in opentelemetry/trace/propagation/tracecontext.py (the regex no longer backtracks, a 512-character limit) plus the version string. All 42 modules identical to the v1.45.2 tag of github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-python (opentelemetry-api/src). Uploaded 2026-10-29, older than 14 days. No attestation (as 1.45.1): the content review is the evidence. OSV: no advisory for 1.45.2."
